# Engineering workflow

## Scope

- Minimize diff size; solve only the requested or approved-plan problem.
- Match existing conventions in the touched files.
- Do not modify unrelated functionality.

## Quality gates (required before completion)

Run applicable commands and fix introduced failures:

- `npm run lint`
- `npm run type-check`
- `npm test`
- `npm run test:integration` (when integration surface changes)
- `npm run build` (before merge-ready work)
- `npm run brand:lint` (when editing marketing/app UI)

Never disable tests or bypass lint/type/build to pass.

## Branch and deployment

- Work on feature branches; never commit directly to `main`.
- Never auto-merge or auto-deploy production.
- Human approval required before merge and production deploy.

## Plan-driven work

- Plans live in `docs/plans/`.
- Read `docs/agent/PLAN_APPROVAL_RULE.md` before implementing any plan.
- Implementation MUST NOT start unless plan STATUS is `APPROVED_FOR_IMPLEMENTATION`.
- Use `node scripts/orchestrator/confirm-approval.js <plan.md>` to verify.

## Documentation

- Agent guides: `docs/agent/`
- Engineering requirements: `AGENTS.md`
